WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Steven, clearly, your focus are the tamale vendors.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.000
That's clearly what you all are trying to get at.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.480
Well, first of all, he uses the term — think about this.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.700
He uses the term invasion force.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:18.680
This fool, Governor Pritzker, uses the term invasion force to describe federal law enforcement.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:23.520
He is adopting the language and the narrative of the paid insurrectionists and the Antifa

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.520
mobs.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:31.360
The invasion force were the 20 million illegal aliens that Biden flooded into this country,

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.639
taking our jobs, taking our wages, filling up our hospitals, destroying God knows how

00:00:36.639 --> 00:00:42.119
many schools, and, of course, leading to countless rapes, assaults, and murders.

00:00:42.119 --> 00:00:43.599
That was the invasion force.

00:00:43.599 --> 00:00:48.520
President Trump has elected on a mandate to turn that invasion back, to send those illegals

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.520
home.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:55.200
Governor Pritzker is providing aid and comfort to the riotous mob that is physically assaulting,

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.439
obstructing, impeding, and attacking ICE officers.

00:00:59.439 --> 00:01:03.520
And his latest act, declaring that there are no-go zones where federal law enforcement

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:09.599
is not permitted, is truly an act of insurrection against the federal government.

00:01:09.599 --> 00:01:15.760
Do you anticipate the federal government will cite the Insurrection Act in order to ramp

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:21.559
up federal presence and federal presence kept safely in a city like Chicago?

